{c: Verse 1}
[Em] [D],        Yeh jo mohabbat hai yeh unaka hain kam
[Em] [D],        Mehboob kaa jo bas lete huye nam
[Am] [G] [D],        Mar jaye mit jaye ho jaye badanam
[Em] [C] [G] [D],        Rehne do chhodo bhi jane do yar,
[D] [G] [Em],        hum na karenge pyar....
[Em] [D] [Am],        Tute agar sagar naya sagar koyi le le
[D] [C] [Em],        Mere khuda dil se koyi kisike ke na khele
